World Bank Open Data

The JSON files in the data directory are taken from World Bank Open Data
(World Development Indicators) and redistributed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International license (CC-BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Files:

- data/fixed_broadband_subscriptions.json
- data/gdp_per_capita_ppp.json
- data/government_education_expenditure_gdp.json
- data/government_health_expenditure_gdp.json
- data/homicide_rate.json
- data/inflation_rate.json
- data/internet_users.json
- data/mobile_subscriptions.json

Source: World Bank Open Data, https://data.worldbank.org/

The values are copied from the World Bank and restructured into JSON. The
World Bank does not endorse this project.



Our World in Data

The following JSON files are taken from Our World in Data and redistributed
under the same Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC-BY 4.0):

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Files:

- data/adult_literacy_rate.json
- data/co2_emissions_per_capita.json
- data/infant_mortality_rate.json
- data/life_expectancy.json
- data/life_satisfaction.json
- data/mean_years_of_schooling.json
- data/pm25_exposure.json

Source: Our World in Data, https://ourworldindata.org/

Life satisfaction is the Cantril ladder score from the Gallup World Poll, as
published by Our World in Data. The values are restructured into JSON. Our
World in Data and Gallup do not endorse this project.



Eurostat

The following JSON files are taken from Eurostat and redistributed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC-BY 4.0). The source
is Eurostat.

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat

Files:

- data/europe/europe_air_passengers.json
- data/europe/europe_average_hourly_wage.json
- data/europe/europe_house_price_index.json
- data/europe/europe_initial_residence_permits.json
- data/europe/europe_minimum_wage.json
- data/europe/europe_motorway_length.json
- data/europe/europe_rail_passengers.json
- data/europe/europe_railway_length.json
- data/europe/europe_rental_cost_index.json
- data/europe/europe_work_permits.json

The values are restructured into JSON. The European Commission does not
endorse this project.



OECD

The following JSON files are taken from the OECD and redistributed with
attribution to the OECD. OECD data and publications are subject to the OECD
Terms and Conditions.

https://www.oecd.org/en/about/terms-and-conditions.html
https://data-explorer.oecd.org/
https://www.oecd.org/en/about/programmes/pisa/

Files:

- data/average_annual_income_per_capita.json
- data/overtime_workers_percentage.json
- data/pisa_mathematics.json
- data/pisa_reading.json
- data/pisa_science.json
- data/tax_wedge.json

Tax wedge, the percentage of employees working long hours, and household
income are from the OECD Data Explorer. PISA mean scores are from PISA 2025 Results (Volume I), Annex B1.
The values are restructured into JSON. The OECD does not endorse this project.



Bank for International Settlements

The following JSON files are taken from the BIS selected residential property
price statistics and redistributed with attribution to the Bank for
International Settlements. Use of BIS statistics is subject to the BIS Terms
of Permitted Use of Statistics.

https://www.bis.org/terms_statistics.htm
https://www.bis.org/statistics/pp.htm

Files:

- data/real_house_price_index.json

The values are restructured into JSON. The Bank for International Settlements
does not endorse this project.
